1
00:00:00,921 --> 00:00:04,011
(Sheldon:)He's not just a middle child,
he is the quintessential middle child.

2
00:00:04,174 --> 00:00:06,884
(Sheldon:)From a broken home, to boot.
Psychologically speaking...

3
00:00:07,052 --> 00:00:10,472
(Sheldon:)...the attention he gets by rebelling,
even to the point of destruction...

4
00:00:10,639 --> 00:00:13,599
(Sheldon:)...is more emotionally valuable
than help he would get at rehab.

5
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:15,647
- I've got a solution.
- Great. What is it?

6
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:18,101
(Leonard:)Get out.

7
00:00:18,981 --> 00:00:20,441
(Leonard:)Fine.

8
00:00:26,363 --> 00:00:27,993
(Sheldon:)I've hesitated to point this out...

9
00:00:28,156 --> 00:00:30,616
...but I must remind you
we are in our predicament...

10
00:00:30,784 --> 00:00:33,074
(Sheldon:)...because of your initial
and inadequate deceit.

11
00:00:33,245 --> 00:00:35,285
(Sheldon:)I'm just trying to clean up
after your mess.

12
00:00:39,626 --> 00:00:41,546
SHELDON:
We'll talk in the morning.

13
00:00:54,016 --> 00:00:55,686
(Leonard:)Morning.

14
00:00:56,268 --> 00:00:57,648
(Leonard:)Who are you?

15
00:00:58,437 --> 00:01:00,027
(Man:)I am Sheldon's cousin Leo.

